        "study_drug_doses_mg": [],
        "population_note": "A 12-week, multi-center, double-blind, randomized, vehicle-controlled, parallel-group Phase 3 monotherapy trial of once-daily topical Encapsulated Benzoyl Peroxide (E-BPO) Cream 5% (S5G4T-1) vs. vehicle cream, 2:1 randomization, in adults with moderate-to-severe (IGA 3-4) papulopustular rosacea (15-70 inflammatory lesions, <=2 nodules). No standardized background therapy regimen: only study product plus a sponsor-provided/study-approved cleanser and moisturizer/sunscreen are permitted on the face; all other topical and most systemic rosacea-relevant medications are prohibited with drug-specific washout periods (2 weeks to 6 months)."
      },
      "source_type": "protocol_pdf_extraction",
